/Title (No Syllabus, Only Signals, an engaging technical event organized by the Electronics Club of V.S.B. Engineering College, was successfully conducted on February 7, 2026, at the DSP Lab. The session brought together enthusiastic students to explore real-world signal-based concepts beyond classroom learning, fostering practical understanding, innovation, and hands-on technical skills in a collaborative environment.)
/Dest [23 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 2673 0 R
/Next 2669 0 R
>>
endobj
2672 0 obj
<<
/Title (Ohm My Guess, a three-stage technical competition organized by the Electronics Club of V.S.B. Engineering College, was successfully conducted on January 31, 2026, at MB-I \(ECE\). The event engaged students in challenging rounds focused on circuit analysis and problem-solving, encouraging participants to apply their core electronics knowledge, enhance critical thinking, and showcase their technical skills in a competitive and collaborative environment.)
/Dest [22 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 2670 0 R
/Next 2673 0 R
>>
endobj
